<section class="app-page">

  <h1 class="flex items-center gap-3 text-3xl font-bold text-brand-text">
    {% icon "fa-solid-network-wired", "h-7 w-7 text-brand-accent" %}
    <span>How this is built</span>
  </h1>
  <p class="mt-2 max-w-prose text-brand-muted">
    Three deployables, two databases and four upstreams. This page is the map — what runs where,
    what holds which data, and what every endpoint is for.
  </p>

  {# --- the flow -----------------------------------------------------------
     Drawn rather than described because the one thing people get wrong about this setup is which
     box talks to which, and a list of hostnames does not answer that. #}
